X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>Visit the <a href="https://www.reimaginingope
 raforkids.org/contact.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reimagining Op
 era for Kids website</a> for more information.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  What happens when your shadow decides to explo
 re the world without you? Head to the Salem Boxcar on October 3 at 1:00 P
 M as Reimagining Opera for Kids presents <em>Ana y su sombra</em>!\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TAGS:Community engagement|PK-12
