SUMMARY:STRUDEL Coding Workshop | Innovation Hour!
DESCRIPTION:Students\, Sign Up Here &gt\;Whether you are interested in co
 mposition\, electronic music\, technology\, or simply trying something ne
 w\, come discover what happens when music and code meet. Developed by Fel
 ix Roos and Alex McLean\, Strudel is an innovative live-coding platform t
 hat allows musicians to create and manipulate music in real time using al
 gorithmic patterns. Popular within the international algorave community\,
  Strudel offers an accessible and exciting way to experiment with new app
 roaches to composition and performance. Led by composer\, educator\, and 
 electronic musician Scott Horton\, this introductory workshop will give y
 ou a hands-on experience with Strudel and live coding—no previous codin
 g experience is necessary.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><a href="https://app.joinhandshake.com/ev
 ents/2033249/share_preview"><strong>Students\, Sign Up Here &gt\;</strong
 ></a><strong><br /></strong>Whether you are interested in composition\, e
 lectronic music\, technology\, or simply trying something new\, come disc
 over what happens when music and code meet. Developed by Felix Roos and A
 lex McLean\, <strong>Strudel</strong> is an innovative live-coding platfo
 rm that allows musicians to create and manipulate music in real time usin
 g algorithmic patterns. Popular within the international algorave communi
 ty\, Strudel offers an accessible and exciting way to experiment with new
  approaches to composition and performance. Led by composer\, educator\, 
 and electronic musician <strong>Scott Horton</strong>\, this introductory
  workshop will give you a hands-on experience with Strudel and live codin
 g—no previous coding experience is necessary.<br /><br /></p>
