DESCRIPTION:Whether you're in your first year of your degree or getting r
 eady to graduate\, the first annual JSOM Career Fair is a great opportuni
 ty for students of all disciplines at Jacobs to connect with regional emp
 loyers\, learn about career paths in performing arts\, and explore intern
 ships and job opportunities. The focus of this fair will be employers int
 erested in attracting professionals with skills and experience in perform
 ance and applied teaching in music\, dance\, and theatre. Watch your IU i
 nbox for information on how to prepare for thefair\, and schedule an appo
 intment with a career advisor to make sure your resumé is fair-ready!
