 mbers of the Guarneri\, Juilliard\, Tokyo\, and Orion quartets\, Ensemble
  Wein-Berlin\, Jaime Laredo\, Lynn Harrell\, Toru Takemitsu\, Peter Schic
 kele\, and John Zorn\, among others. Muroki is also on the faculties of S
 tony Brook University\, the McDuffie Center for Strings at Mercer Univers
 ity\, the Bowdoin International Music Festival\, and the New York String 
