 sserlis\, and Jörg Widmann. As a teacher\, Zorman has held visiting posi
 tions at the Eastman School of Music\, IU\, and McDuffy Center for String
 s. He is a regular faculty member at the Bowdoin International Music Fest
 ival\, Heifetz Institute\, and Keshet Eilon. He has taught master classes
