 (2005)<br /></em>Jenni Brandon: <em>The Woman with the Unfathomable Eyes 
 (2010)<br /></em><br /><strong>About the Artist</strong><br /><br /><stro
 ng>Kimberly Carballo</strong> is senior lecturer in music in chamber and 
