 erne\, Onix\, Manhattan and St. Louis Brass Quintets\, Voices of Change\,
  the Alexander\, Orion and Pacifica string quartets\, the League/ISCM\, E
 arplay\, and the San Francisco Contemporary Music Players. His music has 
