 an\, Iván del Prado\, Mark Russell Smith\, Lawrence Leighton Smith\, Mic
 hael Stern\, Carl Topilow\, David Wiley\, Kirk Trevor\, Thomas Wilkins\, 
 and David Zinman. Honors include two Fromm Music Foundation commissions\;
